                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ4-a6VwCtQjQRb99Ql08KCIM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swMWVERjVhMVpyYldodFFrNUtNSEZUUmxoVGNYYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "5 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Hidden in the alleys of Neihu, \"Honey\u0027s Morning Fun\" is a brunch spot brimming with warmth and stories. It doesn\u0027t follow the glitz and glamour, insisting on using high-quality ingredients, and even has the adorable shop dog \"Honey\" on staff! The atmosphere is incredibly cozy, perfect for a relaxing weekend getaway with your furry friend or friends.\n\n▫️French Platter\n▫️Tomato Stewed Beef Sourdough Bread\n▫️Yogurt Cup\n▫️Ham and Corn Chowder\n▫️Apple Cinnamon Croissant\n▫️Afaqito\n▫️Sea Salt Caramel Latte\n▫️Nut Sesame Soy Milk\n\nRemember to follow us with a heartbeat for fun! 😆 Full blog post: RLai Diary\n\nɪɴꜱᴛᴀɢʀᴀᴍ: fun_rlaisasa",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "隱身內湖巷弄的《哈妮早樂子》，是一間充滿故事溫度的早午餐。不走浮誇路線，堅持真材實料，還有可愛的店狗「哈妮」坐鎮！氛圍超級溫馨，非常適合週末帶毛孩或朋友來放空享受\n\n▫️法式餐盤\n▫️番茄燉牛肉酸種麵包\n▫️優格杯\n▫️火腿玉米濃湯\n▫️蘋果肉桂可頌\n▫️阿法奇朵\n▫️海鹽焦糖拿鐵\n▫️堅果芝麻豆漿\n\n記得按❤️追蹤帶你玩樂生活😆\n完整圖文部落格：RLai Diary\nɪɴꜱᴛᴀɢʀᴀᴍ：fun_rlaisasa",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "fun_rlaisasa",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113346848896589444042/reviews",
