                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ4-a6VwCtQjQRb99Ql08KCIM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSU2FtSkhUMlJHU1hCcVkzSTJlRkp6Y0ROdFkyYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I\u0027ve been to this restaurant so many times! The food is delicious, the environment is comfortable, and the owner is incredibly friendly and beautiful 🥰 Plus, it\u0027s a pet-friendly restaurant. The manager, Hani, is especially gentle and adorable. I even brought my dog-loving kids to play with her during winter break, but unfortunately, Hani wasn\u0027t in a good mood that day, giving us a completely resigned and helpless look 🤣🤣🤣 It cracked us up... Highly recommended! 👍",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "去了好多次的愛店，餐點好吃環境又舒服，老闆本人更是親切又美麗🥰而且還是寵物友善餐廳，尤其店長哈妮溫馴可愛，特地趁寒假帶了超愛狗的孩子們去跟哈妮玩，但偏偏那天哈哈妮心情不美麗，表現出一副生無可戀又無奈的表情🤣🤣🤣笑瘋我們⋯大推👍",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
