                    },
                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ4-a6VwCtQjQRb99Ql08KCIM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CcldsbDNiMk0yVm1RemNHTTFja00yY0d3elRVRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "8 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "What a lovely pet cafe! They offer a high-quality, healthy breakfast, perfect for those who don\u0027t want to eat too many starches or processed foods. The food is delicious, the coffee is great, and they even have latte art!\n\nIt\u0027s pet-friendly! The owner is kind and thoughtful, and the pet meals she prepares are incredibly well-prepared. The environment is clean and tidy, and there\u0027s a cozy little private room where our dog, who loves to pick fights, can stay safe. Thank you so much, owner! See you next time!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "好可愛的一家寵物咖啡廳，而且有很優質的健康早餐，超適合不想吃太多澱粉或者加工食品的人，餐點很好吃咖啡也很好喝還有拉花！\n寵物友善！老闆娘人美心美做的寵物餐也是超用心，環境乾淨整潔，還有一個很舒適的小包廂，讓我們家很愛找別人吵架的狗阿嬤可以安全的在裡面，非常感謝老闆，下次見！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
