                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJ4-a6VwCtQjQRb99Ql08KCIM/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KR1dGRlRUamRyTjA5Q1VFUTNhMFpxUjB0amRGRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "9 months ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The roasted vegetable platter for brunch was delicious, with a variety of vegetables that were roasted to a sweet flavor, and the meat was also tasty. The nut chocolate croissant and cinnamon apple croissant both paired perfectly with lattes! They also serve pet-friendly meals, making it a very nice pet-friendly restaurant!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "烤蔬菜餐盤早午餐很好吃，蔬菜種類多且烤出來有蔬菜甜味，肉也好吃。堅果巧克力可頌跟肉桂蘋果可頌都跟拿鐵很搭！而且還有供應寵物餐，很不錯的寵物友善餐廳！",
